### Option 1: Upload Part 1 (10,000 products ~ 1m 45s)
# @timeout = 300000
POST http://localhost:10001/api/v1/products/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="products_part1.csv"

< ./demo_site/products_part1.csv
--boundary--

